R('ch17','installed_gain',r'\frac{N}{[1 + (1-N) \cdot (C_v/C_{v,\max})^2]^{3/2}}',r'\frac{N}{[N+(1-N)(C_v/C_{v,\max})^2]^{3/2}}')
R('ch17','installed_gain_basis',r'where $G_{\text{inherent}}$ is the inherent valve gain and $N$ is the valve authority.',r'For a fixed available pressure difference, noncavitating incompressible flow and quadratic nonvalve system resistance, let $c=C_v/C_{v,max}$. Then $Q/Q_{max}=c/[N+(1-N)c^2]^{1/2}$; differentiation gives the displayed gain. Here $N$ is authority at full opening and $G_{inherent}=dc/dl$. Other pump/system curves require their own derivation.')
